    "# Causal Inference Analysis: KEC → Neural → Behavioral\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objective**: Establish causal relationships between KEC metrics, neural activity, and reading behavior using advanced causal inference methods.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methods**: \n",
    "- Directed Acyclic Graphs (DAGs)\n",
    "- Causal mediation analysis\n",
    "- Instrumental variables\n",
    "- Sensitivity analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "**Expected Outcomes**: \n",
    "- Causal effect estimates with confidence intervals\n",
    "- Mediation pathways identification\n",
    "- Robustness validation\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
